error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
  --> tests/ui/query_each_escape.rs:18:9
   |
15 |     let mut stash: Vec<&str> = Vec::new();
   |         --------- `stash` declared here, outside of the closure body
16 |     let _ = conn.query_each_sql("SELECT 'x'", |row| {
   |                                                --- `row` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
17 |         let s = row.get::<&str>(0).expect("str");
18 |         stash.push(s);
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `row` escapes the closure body here
   |
   = note: requirement occurs because of a mutable reference to `Vec<&str>`
   = note: mutable references are invariant over their type parameter
   = help: see <https://doc.rust-lang.org/nomicon/subtyping.html> for more information about variance
